{"seq":4,"slug":"flow-models","title":"标准化流模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/gan-and-vae/flow-models","wordCount":1315,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"标准化流模型\">标准化流模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>标准化流（Normalizing Flows）是一类基于可逆变换的生成模型。其核心思想是将简单的基础分布（如标准高斯）通过一系列可逆、可微的变换映射为复杂的数据分布。由于每一步变换都是可逆的，数据的精确对数似然可以通过变量替换公式和雅可比行列式来计算，无需任何近似。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Z[简单分布 z ~ N_0_I] --&gt; F1[变换 f₁]&#10;    F1 --&gt; F2[变换 f₂]&#10;    F2 --&gt; FN[变换 f_N]&#10;    FN --&gt; X[复杂分布 x]&#10;    X --&gt; FNI[f_N⁻¹]&#10;    FNI --&gt; F2I[f₂⁻¹]&#10;    F2I --&gt; F1I[f₁⁻¹]&#10;    F1I --&gt; Z2[标准高斯]\">graph LR\n    Z[简单分布 z ~ N_0_I] --&gt; F1[变换 f₁]\n    F1 --&gt; F2[变换 f₂]\n    F2 --&gt; FN[变换 f_N]\n    FN --&gt; X[复杂分布 x]\n    X --&gt; FNI[f_N⁻¹]\n    FNI --&gt; F2I[f₂⁻¹]\n    F2I --&gt; F1I[f₁⁻¹]\n    F1I --&gt; Z2[标准高斯]</pre><p>变量替换公式为：log p(x) = log p(z) - Σ log |det ∂fᵢ/∂fᵢ₋₁|，其中每一项是变换 fᵢ 的雅可比行列式的对数绝对值。关键的设计挑战是构造既有表达力又能高效计算雅可比行列式的可逆变换。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>标准化流</th>\n<th>VAE</th>\n<th>GAN</th>\n<th>扩散模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确似然</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否（ELBO）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否（ELBO）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可逆性</td>\n<td>完全可逆</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成速度</td>\n<td>快（单步逆变换）</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练目标</td>\n<td>精确 MLE</td>\n<td>ELBO</td>\n<td>对抗损失</td>\n<td>去噪匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐空间</td>\n<td>与数据维度相同</td>\n<td>低维</td>\n<td>低维</td>\n<td>与数据维度相同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型容量</td>\n<td>受可逆约束限制</td>\n<td>灵活</td>\n<td>灵活</td>\n<td>灵活</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"仿射耦合层与-realnvp\">仿射耦合层与 RealNVP</h2><p>RealNVP 提出了仿射耦合层（Affine Coupling Layer），这是标准化流中最常用的构建模块。它将输入 x 分为两部分 x₁ 和 x₂，然后 x₁ 保持不变，x₂ 通过由 x₁ 参数化的仿射变换进行变换：y₁ = x₁，y₂ = x₂ ⊙ exp(s(x₁)) + t(x₁)。其中 s 和 t 是任意神经网络。</p>\n<p>这一设计的精妙之处在于：变换的雅可比矩阵是三角阵，其行列式仅为对角线元素的乘积 exp(Σ sᵢ)，计算复杂度为 O(D) 而非 O(D³)。逆变换同样简单：x₂ = (y₂ - t(y₁)) ⊙ exp(-s(y₁))。通过交替分割维度（偶数层和奇数层分割不同的维度），多个耦合层可以对所有维度施加非线性变换。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class AffineCouplingLayer(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, dim, hidden_dim=256, mask_type=&#39;even&#39;):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.mask = torch.arange(dim) % 2 == (0 if mask_type == &#39;even&#39; else 1)&#10;        half_dim = dim // 2&#10;        self.net = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Linear(half_dim, hidden_dim), nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Linear(hidden_dim, hidden_dim), nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Linear(hidden_dim, half_dim * 2),&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        x1 = x[:, self.mask]&#10;        x2 = x[:, ~self.mask]&#10;        st = self.net(x1)&#10;        s, t = st.chunk(2, dim=-1)&#10;        s = torch.tanh(s) * 2&#10;        y2 = x2 * torch.exp(s) + t&#10;        y = torch.zeros_like(x)&#10;        y[:, self.mask] = x1&#10;        y[:, ~self.mask] = y2&#10;        log_det = s.sum(dim=-1)&#10;        return y, log_det&#10;&#10;    def inverse(self, y):&#10;        y1 = y[:, self.mask]&#10;        y2 = y[:, ~self.mask]&#10;        st = self.net(y1)&#10;        s, t = st.chunk(2, dim=-1)&#10;        s = torch.tanh(s) * 2&#10;        x2 = (y2 - t) * torch.exp(-s)&#10;        x = torch.zeros_like(y)&#10;        x[:, self.mask] = y1&#10;        x[:, ~self.mask] = x2&#10;        return x&#10;&#10;class RealNVP(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, dim, n_layers=6, hidden_dim=256):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.layers = nn.ModuleList()&#10;        for i in range(n_layers):&#10;            mask_type = &#39;even&#39; if i % 2 == 0 else &#39;odd&#39;&#10;            self.layers.append(AffineCouplingLayer(dim, hidden_dim, mask_type))&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        log_det_total = 0&#10;        for layer in self.layers:&#10;            x, log_det = layer(x)&#10;            log_det_total += log_det&#10;        return x, log_det_total&#10;&#10;    def log_prob(self, x):&#10;        z, log_det = self.forward(x)&#10;        log_pz = -0.5 * (z ** 2 + torch.log(torch.tensor(2 * 3.14159))).sum(dim=-1)&#10;        return log_pz + log_det\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AffineCouplingLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, dim, hidden_dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, mask_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'even'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.arange(dim) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mask_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'even'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        half_dim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.net </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E